    "research_notes": {
      "limitations": ["UNICEF’s undated country programme page does not provide sufficient reference-period and methodological detail for all headline statistics.", "The food-policy article was inspected through the search service’s accessible abstract; direct retrieval of the full page failed. Only abstract-supported findings are used.", "Sources were accessed after the editorial cutoff. Historical policies are dated in the prose, and undated programme descriptions are not treated as a verified cutoff-date snapshot."],
      "unverified_items": ["Current enforcement and population-level effectiveness of historical food standards and labelling policies.", "Whether the 2015 dietary guidelines had been superseded by the editorial cutoff."],
      "data_gaps": ["No comparable annual national nutrition series for 2012–2026 was retrieved.", "Inspected prevalence figures differ in age group, geographic coverage or reference-period detail; no synthetic trend or chart was constructed."],
